# API (entry)

Concern rules: `api-http`, `api-throttle`, `api-prisma`, `api-auth`, `api-audience`, `api-integrations`. Map: [`.cursor/rules/README.md`](README.md).

- Nest + PostgreSQL + Prisma 6. Staff identity is `Admin` (not guest `User`).
- Audience: `staff/` + `/staff` (PMS), `domain/` (shared logic), `public/` + `/public` (web Phase 2) — [`api-audience.mdc`](api-audience.mdc).
- Root `.env` only. Overlap in DB/transactions. Sources: `manual` | `website` | `booking_com` | `airbnb` | `agoda`.
- Money ≠ ops (`CONFIRMED` ≠ paid). Quote / `PaymentMovement` / Paid = sum — [`_docs/reservations-design.md`](../../_docs/reservations-design.md).
- List/board/search predicates → Prisma `where` — [`api-prisma.mdc`](api-prisma.mdc).
- iCal updates PMS only — does not refresh OTAs.
- Read `apps/api/AGENTS.md`. Routes: controllers. Depth: `_docs/`.
